    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30256" root="علف" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَفَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>food,</i> or <i>victuals, of soldiers;</i> as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُلُوفَةٌ</span></b>  [which is a pl. of ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَفٌ</span></b> , or perhaps it is
correctly ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلُوفَةٌ</span></b> , which is expl. by Golius as
meaning <i>a stipend,</i> peculiarly <i>of a soldier</i>]. (KL.)

